# Neural Style Transfer (Task-05)

Applies the artistic style of one image (a Kandinsky painting) to the content of another image (a dog photo) using neural style transfer.

## Method
- Based on *A Neural Algorithm of Artistic Style* (Gatys et al.)
- Framework: TensorFlow, pretrained VGG19
- Content loss: keeps the structure of the content image
- Style loss: matches the style using Gram matrices
- Optimizer: Adam (updates the output image pixels)

## How to run
1. Open `Task5_Neural_Style_Transfer.ipynb` in Google Colab.
2. Select a GPU runtime (Runtime → Change runtime type → GPU).
3. Run all cells in order.
